        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>积分公式与三角函数值</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = {\n      tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']] },\n      svg: { fontCache: 'global' }\n    };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-svg.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      background: #fff;\n      color: #111;\n      font-family: \"Times New Roman\", \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 9px 29px 22px 39px;\n      background: #fff;\n    }\n    table.formula-table {\n      width: 472px;\n      border-collapse: collapse;\n      table-layout: fixed;\n      font-size: 15px;\n      line-height: 1.05;\n    }\n    .formula-table td {\n      border: 1px solid #aeb3b7;\n      height: 38px;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n      padding: 3px 8px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .formula-table td:first-child {\n      width: 257px;\n      padding-left: 7px;\n    }\n    .formula-table td:last-child {\n      width: 215px;\n      text-align: center;\n      padding-left: 2px;\n      padding-right: 2px;\n    }\n    .section {\n      margin-top: 11px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 1.65;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n      font-weight: normal;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      margin-bottom: 1px;\n    }\n    .indent-line {\n      padding-left: 0;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .subsection {\n      margin-top: 9px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 1.55;\n    }\n    .root-row {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 15px;\n      margin-top: 2px;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .root-item { display: inline-block; }\n    .special-title {\n      margin-top: 6px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .trig-values {\n      margin-top: 7px;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      line-height: 2.15;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .trig-row {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 94px 111px 119px 103px auto;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n    .trig-row span { display: block; }\n    mjx-container { margin: 0 !important; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n    <table class=\"formula-table\">\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(e^x)\\cdot e^x\\,dx=\\int f(e^x)d(e^x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=e^x$</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(a^x)\\cdot a^x\\,dx=\\dfrac{1}{\\ln a}\\int f(a^x)d(a^x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=a^x$</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(\\sin x)\\cdot\\cos x\\,dx=\\int f(\\sin x)d(\\sin x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=\\sin x$</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(\\cos x)\\cdot\\sin x\\,dx=-\\int f(\\cos x)d(\\cos x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=\\cos x$</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(\\tan x)\\cdot\\sec^2x\\,dx=\\int f(\\tan x)d(\\tan x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=\\tan x$</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(\\cot x)\\cdot\\csc^2x\\,dx=-\\int f(\\cot x)d(\\cot x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=\\cot x$</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(\\arctan x)\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{1+x^2}\\,dx=\\int f(\\arctan x)d(\\arctan x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=\\arctan x$</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>$\\int f(\\arcsin x)\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}\\,dx=\\int f(\\arcsin x)d(\\arcsin x)$</td>\n        <td>$u=\\arcsin x$</td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n\n    <div class=\"section\">\n      <div class=\"section-title\">十、分部积分法公式</div>\n      <div class=\"indent-line\">(1)形如 $\\int x^n e^x dx$，令 $u=x^n$，$dv=e^x dx$</div>\n      <div class=\"indent-line\">　形如 $\\int x^n\\sin xdx$，令 $u=x^n$，$dv=\\sin xdx$</div>\n      <div class=\"indent-line\">　形如 $\\int x^n\\cos xdx$，令 $u=x^n$，$dv=\\cos xdx$</div>\n      <div class=\"indent-line\">(2)形如 $\\int x^n\\arctan xdx$，令 $u=\\arctan x$，$dv=x^n dx$</div>\n      <div class=\"indent-line\">　形如 $\\int x^n\\ln xdx$，令 $u=\\ln x$，$dv=x^n dx$</div>\n      <div class=\"indent-line\">(3)形如 $\\int e^x\\sin xdx$，$\\int e^x\\cos xdx$令 $u=e^x,\\sin x,\\cos x$ 均可。</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"subsection\">\n      <div>十一、常见根式变换中的三角代换</div>\n      <div class=\"root-row\">\n        <span class=\"root-item\">(1) $\\sqrt{a^2-x^2}$　$x=a\\sin t$</span>\n        <span class=\"root-item\">(2) $\\sqrt{a^2+x^2}$　$x=a\\tan t$</span>\n        <span class=\"root-item\">(3) $\\sqrt{x^2-a^2}$　$x=a\\sec t$</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"special-title\">【特殊角的三角函数值】</div>\n\n    <div class=\"trig-values\">\n      <div class=\"trig-row\">\n        <span>(1) $\\sin0=0$</span>\n        <span>(2) $\\sin\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}=\\dfrac12$</span>\n        <span>(3) $\\sin\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$</span>\n        <span>(4) $\\sin\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}=1$</span>\n        <span>(5) $\\sin\\pi=0$</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"trig-row\">\n        <span>(1) $\\cos0=1$</span>\n        <span>(2) $\\cos\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{2}$</span>\n        <span>(3) $\\cos\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}=\\dfrac12$</span>\n        <span>(4) $\\cos\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}=0$</span>\n        <span>(5) $\\cos\\pi=-1$</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"trig-row\">\n        <span>(1) $\\tan0=0$</span>\n        <span>(2) $\\tan\\dfrac{\\pi}{6}=\\dfrac{\\sqrt3}{3}$</span>\n        <span>(3) $\\tan\\dfrac{\\pi}{3}=\\sqrt3$</span>\n        <span>(4) $\\tan\\dfrac{\\pi}{2}$不存在</span>\n        <span>(5) $\\tan\\pi=0$</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
